 want to watch。","verify":"\"Do you want to watch a sitcom?\""},{"id":"cne_j119_q2","topicId":"cne_j119","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"你觉得新闻有教育意义，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I think the news are educational."},{"key":"B","text":"I think the news is educational."},{"key":"C","text":"I think the news is education."},{"key":"D","text":"I am think the news is educational."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"news 作节目名，这里用 is educational。","verify":"\"I think the news is educational.\""},{"id":"cne_j119_q3","topicId":"cne_j119","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"What do you think of talk shows? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"谈话节目在几点"},{"key":"B","text":"你想成为主持人吗"},{"key":"C","text":"你觉得谈话节目怎么样"},{"key":"D","text":"谈话节目是谁的"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"What do you think of 用来问评价。","verify":"\"你觉得谈话节目怎么样\""},{"id":"cne_j119_q4","topicId":"cne_j119","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"你不能忍受这个节目，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I can't stand watch it."},{"key":"B","text":"I can't stands it."},{"key":"C","text":"I am can't stand it."},{"key":"D","text":"I can't stand it."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"can't stand 后面可以直接接 it。","verify":"\"I can't stand it.\""},{"id":"cne_j120_q1","topicId":"cne_j120","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Lisa wants to watch a cartoon. Tom plans to watch the news. 谁想看动画片？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Tom"},{"key":"B","text":"Lisa"},{"key":"C","text":"两个人都想看新闻"},{"key":"D","text":"老师"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Lisa wants to watch a cartoon。","verify":"\"Lisa\""},{"id":"cne_j120_q2","topicId":"cne_j120","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Lisa wants to watch a cartoon. Tom plans to watch the news. Tom 打算看什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"动画片"},{"key":"B","text":"情景喜剧"},{"key":"C","text":"新闻"},{"key":"D","text":"体育比赛"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"plans to watch the news。","verify":"\"新闻\""},{"id":"cne_j120_q3","topicId":"cne_j120","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Gina hopes to watch an educational sitcom. She does not like scary shows. 她喜欢恐怖节目吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"喜欢"},{"key":"B","text":"只在周末看"},{"key":"C","text":"短文没说"},{"key":"D","text":"不喜欢"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"does not like scary shows。","verify":"\"不喜欢\""},{"id":"cne_j120_q4","topicId":"cne_j120","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Gina hopes to watch an educational sitcom. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Gina hopes to watch a sitcom."},{"key":"B","text":"Gina wants to watch the news."},{"key":"C","text":"Gina likes scary shows."},{"key":"D","text":"Gina plans to watch a cartoon."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"hopes to watch an educational sitcom。","verify":"\"Gina hopes to watch a sitcom.\""},{"id":"cne_j133_q1","topicId":"cne_j133","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「邀请」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"preparation"},{"key":"B","text":"concert"},{"key":"C","text":"invitation"},{"key":"D","text":"available"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"invitation 的意思是邀请。","verify":"\"invitation\""},{"id":"cne_j133_q2","topicId":"cne_j133","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「preparation」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"邀请"},{"key":"B","text":"音乐会"},{"key":"C","text":"有空的"},{"key":"D","text":"准备"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"preparation 的意思是准备。","verify":"\"准备\""},{"id":"cne_j133_q3","topicId":"cne_j133","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「音乐会」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"concert"},{"key":"B","text":"invitation"},{"key":"C","text":"preparation"},{"key":"D","text":"available"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"表示音乐会的单词是 concert。","verify":"\"concert\""},{"id":"cne_j133_q4","topicId":"cne_j133","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「有空的」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"invitation"},{"key":"B","text":"available"},{"key":"C","text":"preparation"},{"key":"D","text":"concert"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"available 的意思是有空的。","verify":"\"available\""},{"id":"cne_j134_q1","topicId":"cne_j134","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"邀请对方来聚会，哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Can you to come to my party?"},{"key":"B","text":"Do you can come to my party?"},{"key":"C","text":"Can you coming to my party?"},{"key":"D","text":"Can you come to my party?"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"Can you 后面用动词原形。","verify":"\"Can you come to my party?\""},{"id":"cne_j134_q2","topicId":"cne_j134","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"你很乐意去，哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Sure, I would love to."},{"key":"B","text":"Sure, I would love."},{"key":"C","text":"Sure, I would love coming."},{"key":"D","text":"Sure, I will love to went."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"would love to 后面省略了 come。","verify":"\"Sure, I would love to.\""},{"id":"cne_j134_q3","topicId":"cne_j134","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"那天你得去看医生，哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I have to seeing the doctor."},{"key":"B","text":"I have to see the doctor."},{"key":"C","text":"I has to see the doctor."},{"key":"D","text":"I have see the doctor."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"have to 后面用动词原形。","verify":"\"I have to see the doctor.\""},{"id":"cne_j134_q4","topicId":"cne_j134","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Can you come to the concert? 这句主要是在做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"询问票价"},{"key":"B","text":"描述过去"},{"key":"C","text":"发出邀请"},{"key":"D","text":"比较两场音乐会"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Can you come 常用来邀请。","verify":"\"发出邀请\""},{"id":"cne_j135_q1","topicId":"cne_j135","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"对方邀请你星期六来，你能来，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Sure. I am available on Saturday."},{"key":"B","text":"Sure. I was available on Saturday tomorrow."},{"key":"C","text":"Sure. I am available in Saturday."},{"key":"D","text":"Sure. I available on Saturday."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"on Saturday，并且要有 am。","verify":"\"Sure. I am available on Saturday.\""},{"id":"cne_j135_q2","topicId":"cne_j135","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"你不能去，因为要准备考试。哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Sorry, I have to preparing for a test."},{"key":"B","text":"Sorry, I have to prepare for a test."},{"key":"C","text":"Sorry, I has to prepare for a test."},{"key":"D","text":"Sorry, I have prepare for a test."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"have to prepare。","verify":"\"Sorry, I have to prepare for a test.\""},{"id":"cne_j135_q3","topicId":"cne_j135","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想问对方星期二是否有空，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Do you available on Tuesday?"},{"key":"B","text":"Are you available in Tuesday?"},{"key":"C","text":"Are you available on Tuesday?"},{"key":"D","text":"Are you available at Tuesday?"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"星期前用 on，available 前面用 are。","verify":"\"Are you available on Tuesday?\""},{"id":"cne_j135_q4","topicId":"cne_j135","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"对方说 I might have to meet my friend. 这是什么意思？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他一定能来"},{"key":"B","text":"他昨天见了朋友"},{"key":"C","text":"他不想有朋友"},{"key":"D","text":"他可能得去见朋友"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"might have to 表示可能不得不。","verify":"\"他可能得去见朋友\""},{"id":"cne_j136_q1","topicId":"cne_j136","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Please come to my party on Sunday at 7. It is at my house. 聚会在星期几？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"星期六"},{"key":"B","text":"星期日"},{"key":"C","text":"星期一"},{"key":"D","text":"星期五"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"on Sunday。","verify":"\"星期日\""},{"id":"cne_j136_q2","topicId":"cne_j136","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Please come to my party on Sunday at 7. It is at my house. 在哪里举行？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在学校"},{"key":"B","text":"在音乐会"},{"key":"C","text":"在我家里"},{"key":"D","text":"在医院"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"at my house。","verify":"\"在我家里\""},{"id":"cne_j136_q3","topicId":"cne_j136","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Anna can come. Jeff has to prepare for a test, so he cannot come. 谁不能来？",